owsAffected() == 1; an existing key returns false and database errors propagate. There is no read-then-upsert window, explicit transaction, extra lock SQL or callback.\",\n        \"local_operations\": [\n          {\n            \"line\": 36,\n            \"operation\": \"s.pool.Exec\",\n            \"sql_expression\": \"`\\n\\t\\tINSERT INTO system_settings (key, value, description, updated_at)\\n\\t\\tVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)\\n\\t\\tON CONFLICT (key) DO NOTHING`\",\n            \"status\": \"lexical-order-with-branches-not-single-total-runtime-order\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"direct_lock_fragments\": [],\n        \"implicit_fk\": \"system_settings.key is the existing primary key; this table has no tenant foreign key. The unique-key conflict may wait for another transaction. No row is overwritten on conflict.\"\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"internal/store/postgres/settings.go:35-44 sha256=1ac3664fd7874220598410ce4ee0fd002ff69b9db6f331f4c91e58ba8627234d\",\n        \"Original syntax producers; actual PostgreSQL seed regressions remain separately source-bound.\"\n      ],\n      \"unverified_risks\": [\n        \"Multiple setting keys are separate autocommit statements, not one atomic settings transaction.\",\n        \"Cache refresh and concurrent administrative writes outside this single insertion require their own review.\",\n        \"Original syntax producers only; SQL fragments, name-match callers and local operation order do not prove resolved dispatch, executed SQL or concurrency correctness. Separately bound EXEC product regressions retain their own source identities and limited qualification. This maintenance adds zero implementation TODOs and grants no runtime, release or parent acceptance.\"\n      ],\n      \"review_status\": \"static-type-review\",\n      \"followup_tasks\": [\n        \"R5-P1-030\"\n      ],\n      \"assertions\": {\n        \"direct_sql_effects\": [\n          {\n            \"line\": 36,\n            \"sql_fragment\": \"\\n\\t\\tINSERT INTO system_settings (key, value, description, updated_at)\\n\\t\\tVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)\\n\\t\\tON CONFLICT (key) DO NOTHING\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"direct_lock_fragments\": [],\n        \"transaction_helper_calls\": [],\n        \"sql_execution_expressions\": [\n          {\n            \"line\": 36,\n            \"expr\": \"s.pool.Exec\",\n            \"name\": \"Exec\",\n            \"sql_expr\": \"`\\n\\t\\tINSERT INTO system_settings (key, value, description, updated_at)\\n\\t\\tVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)\\n\\t\\tON CONFLICT (key) DO NOTHING`\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"effec"}
